339
00:21:40,780 --> 00:21:43,960
The bounteous blue world where my father is interred.

340
00:21:44,520 --> 00:21:45,880
Yes, Count Cruteo, it is.

341
00:21:46,320 --> 00:21:47,620
Oh, please don't do that.

342
00:21:48,100 --> 00:21:51,320
I find it a bit awkward when I'm addressed by my father's name.

343
00:21:51,940 --> 00:21:53,640
Please, call me Clonkane.

344
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:54,840
As you would prefer.

345
00:21:55,720 --> 00:21:57,200
My Lord, Clonkane, then.

346
00:21:58,200 --> 00:21:58,800
Thank you.

347
00:21:59,800 --> 00:22:02,140
I can't help but wonder what he will be like.

